   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Maximum: Divine Storm Sovereign</em></p>\n<p>While you are within a storm of your creation, your movement speed increases by 20 ft and you can teleport to a different point within the storm as a bonus action. Additionally when you are reduced to 0 hit points, you can instead melt into storms and reconstitute your form at a different point within the storm at 1 hit point. Once you reconstitute your body using this feature, you cannot use it again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
